---
import { getWaUrl } from '../data/site';
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 via-slate-900 to-slate-800 pt-16 pb-20 text-white sm:pt-24 sm:pb-28">
  <!-- Dekorasi Cahaya Latar -->
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 left-1/2 h-96 w-[42rem] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/20 blur-3xl"></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <!-- Kolom Kiri: Copywriting Utama -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <div class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-indigo-400/30 bg-indigo-500/10 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-300">
          <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
          <span>Slot Pengerjaan Minggu Ini Tersedia</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-3xl leading-tight font-extrabold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl sm:leading-[1.15]">
          Ubah Pengunjung Iklan Menjadi Pembeli dengan
          <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-400 to-emerald-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
            Landing Page Super Cepat
          </span>
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-300 sm:text-lg">
          Jangan biarkan biaya iklan terbuang karena website lambat dan membingungkan. Kami buatkan landing page modern yang ringan, mobile-friendly, dan langsung terhubung ke WhatsApp Anda.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3.5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
          <a
            href={getWaUrl()}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-slate-950 shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/25 transition hover:bg-emerald-400 sm:text-base"
          >
            <span>Pesan via WhatsApp</span>
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
            </svg>
          </a>

          <a
            href="#paket"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/60 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:border-slate-500 hover:bg-slate-800 sm:text-base"
          >
            Lihat Pilihan Paket
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-xs text-slate-400 sm:text-sm">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            Tanpa Biaya Hosting Bulanan
          </span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            Selesai 2–5 Hari Kerja
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Kolom Kanan: Kartu Metrik Performa -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-700/80 bg-slate-800/70 p-6 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-sm">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-700 pb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-rose-500"></span>
              <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span>
              <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
            </div>
            <span class="rounded-md bg-slate-900 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-slate-400">
              Audit Performa Standar
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-center">
            <div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 p-3.5">
              <div class="mx-auto flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-emerald-400 text-base font-extrabold text-emerald-400">
                99
              </div>
              <p class="mt-2 text-xs font-medium text-slate-300">Performance</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 p-3.5">
              <div class="mx-auto flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-emerald-400 text-base font-extrabold text-emerald-400">
                100
              </div>
              <p class="mt-2 text-xs font-medium text-slate-300">Best Practices</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-900/90 p-3.5">
              <div class="mx-auto flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-emerald-400 text-base font-extrabold text-emerald-400">
                100
              </div>
              <p class="mt-2 text-xs font-medium text-slate-300">SEO Ready</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-5 space-y-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/70 p-4 text-xs text-slate-300">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-slate-400">Waktu Muat Awal (FCP)</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-emerald-400">0.4 detik</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-slate-400">Infrastruktur CDN</span>
              <span class="font-semibold text-white">Cloudflare Edge Global</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-slate-400">Keamanan SSL</span>
              <span class="font-semibold text-white">HTTPS Aktif Otomatis</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>